OL,3,GNEWSAJunction improvement plan could
OL,4,Again funding boost
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Bradford junction improvement scheme
OL,7,Ffirst proposed seven years ago is
OL,8,Fexpected to gain a #6.6m boost in
OL,9,Ffunding.
OL,11,FThe junction where Toller Lane, Whetley
OL,12,FHill, Whetley Lane and Carlisle Road
OL,13,Fmeet was first earmarked for major
OL,14,Fimprovements in 2019 as part of a
OL,15,Fcity-wide scheme to reduce congestion
OL,16,Fat the city's busiest junctions.
OL,18,FThe works would see the creation of new
OL,19,Fbus priority signals, eight pedestrian
OL,20,Fcrossings, the closure of Cross Road to
OL,21,Ftraffic and the planting of 54 trees.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
